  "description": "Drift into the silence of space, where every run is a mix of calm exploration and split-second decisions. In Void Miner, you’re not just collecting resources—you’re constantly balancing risk and reward as you weave through dense asteroid fields, dodge hazards, and decide how far into the unknown you’re willing to go before turning back.\n\nEach meteorite you break apart tells a small story of progress. Iron (Fe), copper (Cu), and uranium (U) aren’t just resources—they’re your lifeline. Do you play it safe and cash out early, or push deeper for bigger rewards, knowing one mistake could cost everything you’ve gathered?\n\nThe ship evolves with you. Every upgrade changes how the game feels—faster movement, tighter control, more efficient mining, or new abilities that open up different playstyles. What starts as a fragile craft slowly becomes a finely tuned machine built for deep-space survival.",
